{"channelId":"UC2MVIW4SwvGgOYuGZYyDbPg","row":["Royal Wolverhampton NHS Trust",12700,"Information Videos from Royal Wolverhampton Trust.\nThe Royal Wolverhampton NHS Trust is one of the largest acute and community providers in the West Midlands having more than 800 beds on the New Cross site including intensive care beds and neonatal intensive care cots. \nIt also has 80 rehabilitation beds at West Park Hospital and 54 beds at Cannock Chase Hospital.As the second largest employer in Wolverhampton the Trust employs more than 8,000 staff. \nThe Trust provides its services from the following locations:\nNew Cross Hospital - secondary and tertiary services, maternity, Accident & Emergency, critical care and outpatients. \nWest Park Hospital - rehabilitation inpatient and day care services, therapy services and outpatients.\nMore than 20 Community sites - community services for children and adults, Walk in Centres and therapy and rehabilitation services\nCannock Chase Hospital – general surgery, orthopaedics, breast surgery, urology, dermatology, and medical day case","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2MVIW4SwvGgOYuGZYyDbPg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2MVIW4SwvGgOYuGZYyDbPg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:38.721Z","channelId":"UC2MVIW4SwvGgOYuGZYyDbPg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"edaa8cb117dc0e25581aa212d3a597fb615900b623fda8bbeeedd34c73f9298a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e94bcd70f7062e8ff6f1b97ef252d636b39485721c6d336238035d81089b7fc1"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2MVIW4SwvGgOYuGZYyDbPg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:40:59.763Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2MVIW4SwvGgOYuGZYyDbPg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":12700,"raw":"12.7K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2MVIW4SwvGgOYuGZYyDbPg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09